# The arm of the cell: KUKA KR 210 R2700-2, and two smaller KUKA arms a layout
# may use in its place (src/arm_catalog.h): KR 10 R1100-2 (KR AGILUS) and
# KR 20 R1810-2 (KR CYBERTECH). Only their meshes and the vendor's license are
# downloaded; the models are models/arm.xml, models/kr10_r1100_2.xml and
# models/kr20_r1810_2.xml, converted by hand from the vendor's URDF at this
# same commit. One repository holds all three, so that the outside
# dependencies do not grow. Paths below kuka_quantec_support/meshes/kr210_r2700_2/
# land at visual/... and collision/... in @kuka_kr210_r2700_2; the other
# arms' files are outside that prefix and keep their whole path (only their
